              "[[ex1_4_3]]",
              "[[ex1_4_4]]"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "While Coyotes do hunt other animals, they make up only [[other_prey_diet]]. To further understand how the Coyotes are impacting the population of the prey above, your team begun charting the packs active in each zone. The following are the results:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
