        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Note that kill rates are calculated as [[kill_rate_def]]. It can be assumed that [[hunting_behavior]]. [[year_days]]. The calculated kill rates and the prey populations are used to monitor the predator/prey balance over the year."
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Since the data in Exhibit 2 was collected, your team was able to track each pack for an [[additional_tracking]]. The following additional data was noted:"
        },
